                  <text x={gX(9.8)} y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-accent">9.8 · A100-80GB (QServe)</text>
                  <text x={gX(12.5) + 4} y="106" class="t-small t-accent">≈12.5 · A100-40GB (est.)</text>
                  <text x="70" y="106" class="t-small t-tert">DRAM-bound: byte savings pay</text>
                  <text x="910" y="40" text-anchor="end" class="t-small t-tert">ALU-bound: they don’t</text>
